<title>LATVIA: RIETUMU BECOMES BOURSE MEMBER.</title>
<headline>RIETUMU BECOMES BOURSE MEMBER.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rietumu Bank said on Friday that it has become a member of the bourse and is set to start trading.</p>
<p>&quot;On Thursday, Rietumu Bank became a Riga stock exchange member and will soon enter into bourse trade,&quot; the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>Rietumu produces its own bourse indices, the Rietumu, that covers the whole market, and the Rietumu-16, which covers the 16 biggest shares.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
